    """
    Return a list of text items from `items` that do NOT contain the sequence "ab".
    This will try to use the `funkey` library's filtering if available; if not, it falls
    back to a simple list comprehension so the function remains self-contained.

    Parameters:
    - items: an iterable of items (expected to be strings). Non-strings will be converted
